                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/releases/tag/11.3.6"&gt;11.3.6&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Enhancements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;macOS – Adjust macOS Tray/Menu icons scaling by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/drasticactions/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/drasticactions"&gt;@drasticactions&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3408794000" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19628" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19628/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19628"&gt;#19628&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Windows – Fix OS timer interval calculation in Windows dispatcher by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Swarley97/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Swarley97"&gt;@Swarley97&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3383640381" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19597" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19597/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19597"&gt;#19597&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Windows - Fix maximized window being able to resize by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/emmauss/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/emmauss"&gt;@emmauss&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3403030822" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19620" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19620/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19620"&gt;#19620&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;macOS – Fix SkiaSharp 3 Metal interop signature by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/MrJul/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/MrJul"&gt;@MrJul&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3385621577" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19598" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19598/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19598"&gt;#19598&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;iOS – Backport &lt;code&gt;GRContext&lt;/code&gt; bugfix by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/maxkatz6/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/maxkatz6"&gt;@maxkatz6&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3393318981" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19615" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19615/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19615"&gt;#19615&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;X11 – Ignore empty &lt;code&gt;preeditText&lt;/code&gt; when no composition was active before (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3383280441" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19595" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19595/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19595"&gt;#19595&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Gillibald/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Gillibald"&gt;@Gillibald&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3405434810" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19621" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19621/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19621"&gt;#19621&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Headless – Fix headless &lt;code&gt;FontManager&lt;/code&gt; leak by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/maxkatz6/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/maxkatz6"&gt;@maxkatz6&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3385931146" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19599" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19599/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19599"&gt;#19599&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Text – Fix &lt;code&gt;TextLine.GetTextBounds&lt;/code&gt; zero width run by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Gillibald/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Gillibald"&gt;@Gillibald&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3386648673" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19602" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19602/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19602"&gt;#19602&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Text – Fix &lt;code&gt;TextLineImpl.GetTextBounds&lt;/code&gt; with trailing zero width by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Gillibald/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Gillibald"&gt;@Gillibald&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3393367821" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19616" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19616/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19616"&gt;#19616&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
